containerd: containerd (container runtime)
containerd:
containerd: containerd is an industry-standard container runtime that manages
containerd: the complete container lifecycle on a host: image transfer and
containerd: storage, container execution and supervision, low-level storage
containerd: and network attachments. Docker Engine uses it as its runtime.
containerd:
containerd: This package provides the statically linked binaries containerd,
containerd: containerd-shim-runc-v2, ctr and containerd-stress, built from
containerd: the official sources for Slackware 15.0 (no systemd).
containerd:
containerd: Home: https://containerd.io/